        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Whit Stillman, Greta Gerwig, Taylor Nichols, Adam Brody, Analeigh Tipton, Evan Ross, Leven Rambin, Harold Perrineau\n- Films: Damsels in Distress, Case 219\n- Topics: American film, acting, filmmaking\n\nFacts:\n- Case 219 is a 2010 American drama film starring Evan Ross, Leven Rambin, Taylor Nichols, and Harold Perrineau.\n- Greta Celeste Gerwig was born on August 4, 1983, and she is an American actress and filmmaker.\n- Damsels in Distress is an American comedy film written and directed by Whit Stillman and starring Greta Gerwig, Adam Brody, and Analeigh Tipton.\n- Damsels in Distress had the original titles Violet Wister's Damsels in Distress and Whit Stillman's Damsels in Distress.\n- Cecil Taylor Nichols was born on March 3, 1959, in Louisville, Kentucky, and he is an American actor.\n- Taylor Nichols is best known for roles in Whit Stillman films including Metropolitan, Barcelona, The Last Days of Disco, and Damsels in Distress.",
